  "plot": "In the overcrowded sprawl of Mega City One, Judge Dredd serves as the most feared enforcer of a legal system that grants Judges total authority over crime and punishment. After Fergee is swept back into custody during a violent gang conflict, Dredd continues his relentless duties while escaped convict Rico secretly returns to the city. A series of murders soon places suspicion on Dredd himself, culminating in a public trial that overturns his reputation and removes him from power. As Hershey investigates inconsistencies in the case, buried secrets tied to a classified genetic program begin to surface. Forced into exile alongside the reluctant Fergee, Dredd uncovers evidence of a wider plot that threatens the stability of Mega City One and the future of the Judge order.",
  "simplePlot": "In the overcrowded sprawl of Mega City One, Judge Dredd serves as the most feared enforcer of a legal system that grants Judges total authority over crime and punishment. After Fergee is swept back into custody during a violent gang conflict, Dredd continues his relentless duties while escaped convict Rico secretly returns to the city. A series of murders soon places suspicion on Dredd himself, culminating in a public trial that overturns his reputation and removes him from power. As Hershey investigates inconsistencies in the case, buried secrets tied to a classified genetic program begin to surface. Forced into exile alongside the reluctant Fergee, Dredd uncovers evidence of a wider plot that threatens the stability of Mega City One and the future of the Judge order.",
